extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DdakP-U8jCoQ7kNvwGiTFlH&_nc_oc=Adp4ZDUjiFAXDupTIehjDR7V0lkoNDH6vfHZeFQqNiq0TsCCn86lQdd9bAo_Wgt9Sxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPOBhiE__DOBPvJ4UJTLiKMI4s4XjDVRSwX-7l1v19Pfw&oe=6AC11D56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7s9XvirbcNoQ7kNvwF58tAK&_nc_oc=AdoluEpQoKP_LXqT09sNfZlzBbuhNDxJ9VjZhmcbwq3OT9gW0L7IpZguI9Zqfedv-ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO4ny8KyhR8KapF8WJxqiyzAwUlHP2C_NvojabQl1E_hw&oe=6AC124A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=erAH7z5ZcEEQ7kNvwEuYQwC&_nc_oc=AdomsLdFb_G-ZdIICqPVkV46HsbybL7DbdlEW_h6V9SY2YxmYYMLkf-3Os_s38hQA3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPiHnCikxAMBKi2bt3UdCa7DsB1ZyWqfoQCyjMqo0crkA&oe=6AC12C99"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":